  "chapter": {
    "number": 53,
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "hebrew_subtitle",
        "content": [
          "(54) For the end, among Hymns of instruction by David, when the Ziphites came and said to Saul, Behold, is not David hid with us?"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 1,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Save me, O God, by your name, and judge me by your might.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "O God, hear my prayer; listen to the words of my mouth.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "For strangers have risen up against me, and mighty men have sought my life: they have not set God before them. Pause.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 4,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "For behold! God assists me; and the Lord is the helper of my soul.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 5,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "He shall return evil to my enemies; utterly destroy them in your truth.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 6,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "I will willingly sacrifice to you: I will give thanks to your name, O Lord; for it is good.",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "lineBreak": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 7,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "For you have delivered me out of all affliction, and my eye has seen my desire upon my enemies.",
            "poem": 1
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "footnotes": []
  },
